@startuml
title Observable states and authority

state "VBUS absent" as NoVbus
state "VBUS present" as Vbus
state "Device presented" as Presented
state "Host detected" as Connected
state "Address assigned" as Addressed
state "Active configuration" as Mounted
state "Class ready" as Ready
state "USB route adopted" as Routed

[*] --> NoVbus
NoVbus --> Vbus : power detected
Vbus --> Presented : pull-up enabled
Presented --> Connected : reset or setup packet
Connected --> Addressed : SET_ADDRESS
Addressed --> Mounted : SET_CONFIGURATION
Mounted --> Ready : class requirements
Ready --> Routed : application decision

note right of Vbus
  Proves power,
  not communication.
end note

note right of Mounted
  tud_mounted()
end note
@enduml
